Metasploit can use payloads that establish reverse connections.

Conceptually:

```text
Exploit
   ↓
Payload
   ↓
Target
   ↓
Reverse connection
   ↓
Metasploit listener
   ↓
Session
```

Remember from Day 36:

> **Exploit = takes advantage of vulnerability**

