# 26. REVERSE SHELL VS METERPRETER

A basic shell generally provides:

```text
Command execution
```

Meterpreter is a richer Metasploit session environment providing additional capabilities.

Conceptually:

```text
Basic shell:
command → output

Meterpreter:
session → broader controlled post-exploitation functionality
```

Exam trap:

> Meterpreter is not itself a reverse shell type; it is a Metasploit payload/session environment.

