# 43. FIREWALL TROUBLESHOOTING

A reverse connection can fail because of:

```text
Target firewall
Network firewall
Host firewall
Egress filtering
NAT
Proxy
Endpoint security
Wrong interface
Wrong port
```

Do not assume:

> "The exploit failed."

It may simply be a network problem.

