# 49. REVERSE SHELL VS BIND SHELL — EXAM TABLE

| Question | Reverse Shell | Bind Shell |
|---|---|---|
| Who listens? | Operator | Target |
| Who initiates? | Target | Operator |
| Connection direction | Target → Operator | Operator → Target |
| Target listening port? | Usually no | Yes |
| Outbound filtering important? | Yes | Less directly |
| Inbound filtering important? | Less directly | Yes |
| Main memory trick | Target calls back | Target waits |

